&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Golang Codereview Comments</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/c0ab4091d733d85471515c2cd581fd67/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 Oct 2021 16:32:43 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/c0ab4091d733d85471515c2cd581fd67/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Multiple Git Ssh Config Single Machine</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/d881fb4640d6de032e6221c9eabe0e39/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 Oct 2021 10:21:50 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/d881fb4640d6de032e6221c9eabe0e39/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;To use multiple github account on same hosts, and using ssh to push and pull the repo. We have multiple tricks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using ssh config tricks with hosts: &lt;a href="https://gist.github.com/JoaquimLey/e6049a12c8fd2923611802384cd2fb4a"&gt;https://gist.github.com/JoaquimLey/e6049a12c8fd2923611802384cd2fb4a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Used host trick before, but while setting up again and looking for documentation found this neat way using &lt;code&gt;gitconfig&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We can have to first set &lt;code&gt;.gitconfig&lt;/code&gt; file in home directory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;gitdir:~/workspace/work/&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ./.gitconfig-work
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[includeIf &amp;#34;gitdir:~/workspace/personal/&amp;#34;]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; path = ./.gitconfig-personal
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;.gitconfig-work&lt;/code&gt; file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[user]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; email = &amp;#34;sumit.murari@work.com&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[core]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; sshCommand = &amp;#34;ssh -i ~/.ssh/id_rsa&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;.gitconfig-personal&lt;/code&gt; file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[user]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; email = &amp;#34;murari.sumit@fastmail.com&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;[core]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; sshCommand = &amp;#34;ssh -i ~/.ssh/personal-ecdsa&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Post Your Startup</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/492e142b3d2566623e4ba229d743b355/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 Oct 2021 08:25:31 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/492e142b3d2566623e4ba229d743b355/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Place where we can post about startup, found this list. Keeping here for reference as tags are easy to track now for me.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>K8s Failure Stories</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/k8s-failure-stories/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Aug 2021 00:37:09 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/k8s-failure-stories/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Awesome Docker Compose</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/awesome-docker-compose/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Aug 2021 00:16:18 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/awesome-docker-compose/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Kuberentes Kbrew</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/k8s-kbrew/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Aug 2021 13:33:47 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/k8s-kbrew/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This tool looks good, and love the ease of this. It&amp;rsquo;s easy way to deploy the applications over cluster.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>